WEBVTT

00:11:29.266 --> 00:11:31.282
Take what you've learned and accomplished

00:11:31.306 --> 00:11:32.528
and shift into a mode

00:11:32.552 --> 00:11:35.631
where you can transmit your knowledge
and skills to other people.

00:11:35.655 --> 00:11:37.099
Become a teacher or a mentor.

00:11:37.123 --> 00:11:39.686
AB: And frankly,
the world needs those people.

00:11:39.710 --> 00:11:41.381
And we don't have enough of them.

00:11:41.405 --> 00:11:43.368
When I'm at a certain point in my career,

00:11:43.392 --> 00:11:46.860
and I see that I'm not
on the top of my game,

00:11:46.884 --> 00:11:51.352
I need to start thinking,
is what got me here,

00:11:51.376 --> 00:11:54.030
whether it's the insight or the innovation

00:11:54.054 --> 00:11:57.481
or whatever it happens
to be that got me here,

00:11:57.505 --> 00:11:59.203
is it something that I can sustain?

00:11:59.227 --> 00:12:02.543
If it's not, start looking
for something else.